sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User / kubectl
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant Reconciler as OGXServerReconciler<br/>ogx-k8s-operator
    participant ModReconciler as OGX Reconciler<br/>ogx-module
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus Operator

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 1: OGXServer Reconciliation

    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl create OGXServer CR<br/>(ogx.io/v1beta1)
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Admission review<br/>POST /validate-ogx-io-v1beta1-ogxserver<br/>Fail policy
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response<br/>(allow/deny)
    K8sAPI-->>User: CR created / rejected

    K8sAPI->>Reconciler: Watch event: OGXServer created
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Get Secrets<br/>(label: app.kubernetes.io/managed-by: ogx-operator)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Model credentials
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Get ConfigMaps<br/>(label-scoped watch)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Runtime configuration

    par Create child resources
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create Deployment<br/>(inference server image)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create Service
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create HPA
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create PDB
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create NetworkPolicy
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create ConfigMap
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create Ingress (optional)
        Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create PVC (optional)
    end

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update OGXServer/status

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 2: OGX Platform Component Lifecycle

    K8sAPI->>ModReconciler: Watch event: OGX CR<br/>(components.platform.opendatahub.io)
    ModReconciler->>ModReconciler: Platform detection<br/>(ODH vs RHOAI)
    ModReconciler->>ModReconciler: Render kustomize manifests<br/>(odh-platform-utilities)

    par Install operator resources
        ModReconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update operator Deployment
        ModReconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update CRDs
        ModReconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update RBAC
        ModReconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ValidatingWebhookConfiguration
        ModReconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Services
    end

    ModReconciler->>K8sAPI: Update OGX/status

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 3: Monitoring Integration

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update PrometheusRules<br/>(monitoring.coreos.com)
    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Create/Update ServiceMonitors<br/>(monitoring.coreos.com)
    Prometheus->>K8sAPI: Watch PrometheusRules & ServiceMonitors
    Prometheus-->>Prometheus: Configure scrape targets

    Note over User,Prometheus: Flow 4: TLS Configuration at Startup

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: GET APIServer TLS profile<br/>(config.openshift.io/apiservers)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: TLS profile<br/>(or Intermediate fallback)
    Reconciler->>Reconciler: Apply TLS config to webhook server
